{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a6e9abf9f2b18b66a3d18f7888eb972005db7cc9695e64c58c95480a09f6f5a7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比倫的下場"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["此後，我看見另一位執掌大權的天使從天而降，他的榮光照亮了大地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他用強有力的聲音喊道：",{"text":"「巴比倫大城倒塌了！倒塌了！","poem":1},{"noteId":23},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她成了鬼魔的住處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各樣污穢之靈的巢穴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各樣污穢之鳥的老巢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各樣污穢可憎之獸的老窩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為列國都喝了她淫亂的烈酒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的君王與她通姦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的商人也因她窮奢極侈的生活而發了財。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我聽見天上又有一個聲音說：",{"text":"「我的子民啊，離開那城，","poem":1},{"noteId":24},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以免沾染她的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受她所受的災禍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她已經罪惡滔天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝沒有忘記她的不義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她怎樣待人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也要怎樣待她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要按她所做的加倍地報應她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用她調酒的杯加倍地調給她喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她過去怎樣自炫自耀、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奢華荒淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在也要讓她怎樣痛苦哀傷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她心裡說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我貴為女王，不是寡婦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"絕不會經歷哀傷。』","poem":1},{"noteId":25}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以在一天之內，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的災禍，就是死亡、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀傷和饑荒要同時臨到她身上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她要被火燒盡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為審判她的主上帝大有能力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「地上曾與她通姦、一同奢華享樂的君王目睹焚燒她的煙，必為她哭泣哀號。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他們對她所受的災禍充滿恐懼，就遠遠地站著說，",{"text":"「『雄偉堅固的巴比倫城啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有禍了！有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為審判頃刻間臨到你了。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["「地上的商人也為她痛哭哀傷，因為再也沒有人購買他們的貨物了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們的金、銀、寶石、珍珠、細麻布、紫布、絲綢、朱紅色布、各種香木、象牙器具，貴重木材、銅、鐵、大理石製品，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["以及肉桂、荳蔻、香料、香膏、乳香、酒、油、細麵粉、小麥、牛、羊、馬、車、僕婢和人口都沒有人購買了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他們呼喊，『你貪愛的美物已離你而去了，一切珍饈美味和奢華之物都消失殆盡，無影無蹤。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["「靠販賣這些貨物給她而致富的商人對她所受的災禍充滿恐懼，就站在遠處為她哀傷哭號，"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["說，『身穿紫色和朱紅色細麻布衣服，並用黃金、寶石、珍珠為裝飾的大城啊，有禍了！有禍了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["因為頃刻間你這一切的繁華都化為烏有了。』所有船主、船客、水手及靠海為生的人都遠遠地站著，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["看見燒她的煙，就高喊，『有哪一座城能與這座大城相比呢？』"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["他們又把塵土撒在頭上，哀傷哭泣，高喊，",{"text":"「『這大城啊，有禍了！有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有經營航運的都因她的奢華而發了財，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是頃刻間她卻淪為廢墟了！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上天啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾聖徒、眾使徒和眾先知啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為她的下場歡喜吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為上帝已經對她下了判決，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為你們伸冤了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["這時，有一位大能天使舉起一塊像大磨石的石頭扔進海裡，說：",{"text":"「巴比倫大城也必這樣被用力扔下去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"消失得無影無蹤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你那裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也聽不見彈琴作樂、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弄笛吹號的聲音了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也找不到能工巧匠了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也聽不到推磨的聲音了，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也看不到閃耀的燈光了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也聽不見新郎新娘的聲音了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你的商人在世上顯赫一時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國都被你的邪術迷惑，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的城內流了眾先知、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾聖徒和地上一切被殺之人的血。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":23,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書21·9。","reference":{"chapter":18,"verse":2}},{"noteId":24,"caller":"+","text":"耶利米書51·45。","reference":{"chapter":18,"verse":4}},{"noteId":25,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書47·7、8。","reference":{"chapter":18,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}